      "summary": "Jarrid Trudeau, evp of sales for of Kristoff Cigars, used artificial intelligence to analyze cigar feedback from hundreds of sources to guide the company's newest blend. He drew on professional reviews, consumer forums, retailers' review sections and more to train a model that would show what consumers like and don't like in a cigar. The post Kristoff.ai Debuts at Two Guys Cigars appeared first on halfwheel",
